'''Leequa''' was a location on the planet [[Ghorman]]. In [[2 BBY]],<ref name="208Date">{{AndorDate|208}}</ref> [[gouge mining]] [[Mining rig|equipment]] sent from an [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[Fleet|armada]] landed at Leequa in order to harvest the planet's [[kalkite]] deposits for the emperor's "[[Project Stardust|Energy Initiative]]".<ref name="One Year Later">"[[One Year Later]]" identifies [[kalkite]] as the target mineral of Imperial mining on [[Ghorman]].</ref><ref name="WAY" />

